('Yaniel','Explicit old woman and veteran paladin.','cedf416f4d873d0468b01270c7b8eb9e','cbf1a11c8d3ce814595149a211502ad1','New route after genuine Midnight Fane rescue and Radiance recognition.','Fake Yaniel is a separate impersonation. Rescue trauma and possible later death need distinct state handling.'),
('Delamere','Established adult priestess with renowned former career; currently dead.','a20b6707b07208a43928f0a6a9309053','a1a2f1c5e80483649a6d51805a3cd0fb','Experimental autonomous restoration, then a chosen new relationship.','Native compelled undead obedience and hatred cannot be romance consent. Restore agency, not merely a speaking body.'),
('Elyanka Camilary','Explicit old woman, presently mortal; sixteen describes a past event.','13ea42e5da39a694499bb516b8478269','836b49836cd1fb44496ccde3175d74ea','New route on all mythic paths, with a bespoke Trickster introduction beyond her native Lich-centered access.','Her desired undeath is not a condition she already possesses. Preserve fanaticism and Septimus conflict.'),
('Herrax','Adult succubus and brothel madam portrayal; exact age unstated.','1439d3385a918d048be42bf6c66f1cd6','fa4d223f55e2140479ece30fb929ff36','New route around succession at Ten Thousand Delights and independent patronage.','Scars, damaged eye and ragged wings are native features. Brothel service is not personal romantic consent. Coordinate Chivarro/Minagho existing integration.'),
('Mielarah','Adult captain/sorceress portrayal with established career; exact age unstated.','8235006c1e10df244a3467c7b3900f2a','1b4e78245cb3a244588f9ec0fda54ea8','New voyage route addressing Gravedragger curse and choices aboard Starcatcher the Third.','Do not flatten principled captain into innocent heroine: thought-correction and disastrous coercion are also native. Travel outcomes need rescue alternatives.'),
('Shamira','Adult demonic patron/ruler portrayal; exact age unstated.','ab7955d6c7e01d9489f382d77572a9e1','76f6e12133981714eaf235d1bf799144','New intrigue route on all mythic paths through a path-appropriate Harem audience and political stakes, including authored Trickster alternatives.','Telepathy, coercive information demands and dangerous ambition remain; submission or mental intrusion does not prove affection.'),
