('Iomedae','Adult-presenting goddess with warrior history, not a mortal age claim.','392b3c9308ec3cc489579720f11ea8d7','48c4c2d62b5217a4fa2f827cfeeddc59','Highly experimental divine audience route on every mythic path; Trickster access and reciprocal personal interest would be new.','Native congratulations or approval do not imply romance. Preserve duty and independence; no mortal recruitment pretense.'),
